# AI Gateway 
 
An intelligent, unified AI API with dope features.

## Dope Features

- A singular endpoint to interact with LLMs from any provider we can access
    - Supports multiple models from different providers
- Configurable, Automatic Retries
- Configurable Fallback Mechanisms
- Load Balancing across providers
- Configurable, Intelligent Model Router
  - Selects Models based on Step of Task 
  - Select based on Cost or Performance
  - Continuously Self Improving Router
  - Feedback Loop for Router Improvements
- Semantic Caching
- Observability
  - Monitoring
  - Logging
- Prompt Management
  - Prompt Templates
  - Prompt Partials 
- Evaluations
- 